docs {
  Endpoint: GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cities?name={term}
  Search cities by name substring.

  Query: `name` string, required for useful filtering.

  Response 200: `{ "cities": [...] }`.
  Example: `GET /api/cities?name=Budapest`.
